{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "diagram_type": "workflow",
  "meta": {
    "title": "Flujo en dos fases",
    "subtitle": "Rama de tarea → PR de tarea → plan/* → PR del plan → main → tag v* → publicación",
    "output": "docs/architecture/diagrams/rendered/D02.html",
    "locale": "es",
    "animation": "none",
    "visual_preset": "blueprint"
  },
  "lanes": [
    { "id": "author", "label": "Rama de tarea" },
    { "id": "plan", "label": "Rama de plan" },
    { "id": "main", "label": "main" },
    { "id": "release", "label": "Release" }
  ],
  "phases": [
    {
      "id": "fase1",
      "label": "Fase 1 · integración",
      "fromCol": 0,
      "toCol": 3,
      "variant": "emphasis"
    },
    {
      "id": "fase2",
      "label": "Fase 2 · publicación",
      "fromCol": 4,
      "toCol": 5,
      "variant": "dashed"
    }
  ],
  "mainPath": [
    "task_branch",
    "task_pr",
    "plan_branch",
    "plan_pr",
    "main_squash",
    "cut_tag",
    "publish"
  ],
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "task_branch",
      "lane": "author",
      "col": 0,
      "type": "frontend",
      "label": "Rama de tarea",
      "sublabel": "<tipo>/<slug>",
      "tag": "sale de plan/*"
    },
    {
      "id": "task_pr",
      "lane": "author",
      "col": 1,
      "type": "frontend",
      "label": "PR de tarea",
      "sublabel": "hacia plan/*",
      "tag": "Conventional"
    },
    {
      "id": "plan_branch",
      "lane": "plan",
      "col": 2,
      "type": "backend",
      "label": "plan/<id>",
      "sublabel": "squash del PR",
      "tag": "Fase 1"
    },
    {
      "id": "plan_pr",
      "lane": "plan",
      "col": 3,
      "type": "backend",
      "label": "PR del plan",
      "sublabel": "borrador",
      "tag": "COMMIT_OVERRIDE"
    },
    {
      "id": "main_squash",
      "lane": "main",
      "col": 4,
      "type": "cloud",
      "label": "main",
      "sublabel": "squash del plan",
      "tag": "firma de GitHub"
    },
    {
      "id": "cut_tag",
      "lane": "main",
      "col": 5,
      "type": "cloud",
      "label": "tag v*",
      "sublabel": "release.yml",
      "tag": "cut_tag.py"
    },
    {
      "id": "publish",
      "lane": "release",
      "col": 5,
      "type": "external",
      "label": "Publicación",
      "sublabel": "Release",
      "tag": "provenance"
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
    { "from": "task_branch", "to": "task_pr" },
    {
      "from": "task_pr",
      "to": "plan_branch",
      "label": "ci-gate + squash",
      "variant": "emphasis"
    },
    { "from": "plan_branch", "to": "plan_pr" },
    {
      "from": "plan_pr",
      "to": "main_squash",
      "label": "ci-gate + squash",
      "variant": "emphasis"
    },
    {
      "from": "main_squash",
      "to": "cut_tag",
      "label": "release.yml",
      "variant": "dashed",
      "labelAt": [563, 415]
    },
    {
      "from": "cut_tag",
      "to": "publish",
      "label": "Release",
      "variant": "emphasis",
      "labelDy": 11
    }
  ],
  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Fase 1 · integración",
      "items": [
        "Cada tarea es una rama y un PR hacia plan/<id>, nunca hacia main",
        "El squash solo ocurre con ci-gate en verde; sin --merge, sin --rebase y sin --admin",
        "Al cerrar la fase se entrega el informe de STOP y se espera al Arquitecto"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Fase 2 · publicación",
      "items": [
        "El PR del plan se abre en borrador y lo fusiona Alejandro",
        "release.yml corta el tag v* al fusionar; nunca se crea a mano",
        "Nada se publica desde un PR de tarea"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Cuándo se para",
      "items": [
        "Un criterio con un código de salida distinto del esperado es una desviación y se reporta",
        "Un PR que toca rutas de política queda verde con policy-exception y lo fusiona el Arquitecto",
        "Un fallo de ci-gate ajeno a los cambios de la tarea, dos veces seguidas, para la fase"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
